{"t":"Berserk","s":"berserk-41c71","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Berserk_322877.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Berserk</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Berserk\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_322877.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">125</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">35</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">44</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Performs a whirlwind attack, dealing damage acording to the weapon characteristics to all surrounding targets.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Handling a weapon well demands great skill and long training. Experienced knights can perform a magically enhanced special attack that no other vocation can master. The Berserk spell enables a warrior to lash out at all enemies surrounding him with one devastating attack. The power of the attack will rise with his skill to handle the weapon he is carrying. Moreover, the type of damage a knight is dealing when casting this spell, always depends on the weapon he is carrying.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Berserk animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_animation_02a208.gif\" width=\"160\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>It used to have a different animation: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Berserk1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk1_558692.gif\" width=\"160\"/></span></li>\n<li>Before the Summer Update 2007, Berserk was much stronger and required a variable amount of mana, equal to the character level times four.</li>\n<li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 increased the mana cost from 115 to 125.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Attack_Spells\">Attack Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Annihilation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Apprentice%27s%20Strike\">Apprentice's Strike</a></li><li>Brutal Strike</li><li>Buzz</li><li>Chained Penance</li><li>Chill Out</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a></li><li>Death Echo</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a></li><li>Devastating Knockout</li><li>Divine Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a></li><li>Divine Grenade</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a></li><li>Double Jab</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Electrify\">Electrify</a></li><li>Energy Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Winter\">Eternal Winter</a></li><li>Ethereal Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Spear\">Ethereal Spear</a></li><li>Executioner's Throw</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a></li><li>Fire Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a></li><li>Flurry of Blows</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Forceful%20Uppercut\">Forceful Uppercut</a></li><li>Forked Glacier</li><li>Forked Thorns</li><li>Front Sweep</li><li>Great Death Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fire%20Wave\">Great Fire Wave</a></li><li>Greater Flurry of Blows</li><li>Greater Tiger Clash</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Groundshaker\">Groundshaker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hell%27s%20Core\">Hell's Core</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Flash\">Holy Flash</a></li><li>Ice Burst</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a></li><li>Ice Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ignite\">Ignite</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inflict%20Wound\">Inflict Wound</a></li><li>Lesser Ethereal Spear</li><li>Lesser Front Sweep</li><li>Lesser Mystic Repulse</li><li>Lightning</li><li>Mud Attack</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Repulse\">Mystic Repulse</a></li><li>Physical Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a></li><li>Scorch</li><li>Shield Bash</li><li>Shield Slam</li><li>Spiritual Outburst</li><li>Strong Energy Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ethereal%20Spear\">Strong Ethereal Spear</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Flame%20Strike\">Strong Flame Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Strike\">Strong Ice Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Wave\">Strong Ice Wave</a></li><li>Strong Terra Strike</li><li>Sweeping Takedown</li><li>Swift Jab</li><li>Terra Burst</li><li>Terra Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Wave\">Terra Wave</a></li><li>Thousand Fist Blows</li><li>Tiger Clash</li><li>Ultimate Energy Strike</li><li>Ultimate Flame Strike</li><li>Ultimate Ice Strike</li><li>Ultimate Terra Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whirlwind%20Throw\">Whirlwind Throw</a></li><li><a href